{"seq":1,"slug":"type-annotations","title":"类型标注与 typing 模块","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system/type-annotations","wordCount":1058,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"类型标注与-typing-模块\">类型标注与 typing 模块</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>Python 类型标注（Type Annotations）是一套在源码中声明变量、参数和返回值类型的语法规范。它不影响运行时行为，但能被 mypy、pyright 等静态分析工具用来发现潜在错误。从 Python 3.9 开始，内置容器类型可直接用于标注，无需从 typing 导入。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>类型标注是写给静态分析工具的<strong>元数据</strong>，运行时不会强制执行——Python 依旧是动态语言，标注写错不会在运行时报错，只会被 mypy 之类的工具提前发现。理解它需要抓住三点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>静态而非运行时</strong>：标注不改变程序行为；运行时校验是另一条独立主线，由 Pydantic 之类的库承担。</li>\n<li><strong>版本驱动简化</strong>：3.9 起内置容器可直接参数化（<code>list[int]</code>），3.10 起支持 <code>int | str</code>，3.12 起支持 <code>def f[T]</code>，旧写法逐步被取代。</li>\n<li><strong>渐进可采纳</strong>：类型系统允许从公共 API 开始，逐模块收紧，最终才开启 <code>strict</code>。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>静态标注（mypy）</th>\n<th>运行时验证（Pydantic）</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>生效时机</td>\n<td>开发期 / CI</td>\n<td>程序运行期</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>失败表现</td>\n<td>静态检查报错</td>\n<td>抛异常</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>覆盖数据</td>\n<td>代码内部</td>\n<td>外部边界</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>运行开销</td>\n<td>零</td>\n<td>有解析与校验成本</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"基本标注语法\">基本标注语法</h2><h3 id=\"变量与函数标注\">变量与函数标注</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"name: str = &quot;Alice&quot;&#10;age: int = 30&#10;is_active: bool = True&#10;&#10;def greet(name: str, times: int = 1) -&gt; str:&#10;    return f&quot;Hello, {name}! &quot; * times\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"Alice\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">age: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">is_active: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> True</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> greet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, times: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Hello, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">! \"</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> times</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"python-版本演进\">Python 版本演进</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>版本</th>\n<th>变化</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>3.5</td>\n<td>PEP 484 引入类型标注</td>\n<td><code>def f(x: int) -&gt; int</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.6</td>\n<td>PEP 526 变量标注</td>\n<td><code>name: str = &quot;hi&quot;</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.9</td>\n<td>PEP 585 内置泛型</td>\n<td><code>list[int]</code> 替代 <code>List[int]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.10</td>\n<td>PEP 604 联合类型语法</td>\n<td><code>int | str</code> 替代 <code>Union</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3.12</td>\n<td>PEP 695 类型参数语法</td>\n<td><code>def f[T](x: T) -&gt; T</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"typing-模块核心类型\">typing 模块核心类型</h2><h3 id=\"容器与联合类型\">容器与联合类型</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from typing import Optional, Union&#10;&#10;def find_user(user_id: int) -&gt; Optional[dict]:&#10;    ...&#10;&#10;def process(value: Union[str, int]) -&gt; str:&#10;    return str(value)&#10;&#10;scores: list[int] = [90, 85, 78]&#10;config: dict[str, int | str] = {&quot;timeout&quot;: 30, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;app&quot;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Optional, Union</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> find_user</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user_id: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) -> Optional[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value: Union[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scores: list[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">90</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">85</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">78</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">config: dict[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"timeout\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"app\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"可调用类型与别名\">可调用类型与别名</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from typing import Callable, TypeAlias&#10;&#10;Handler = Callable[[str, int], bool]&#10;JSON: TypeAlias = dict[str, &quot;JSON&quot;] | list[&quot;JSON&quot;] | str | int | float | bool | None&#10;&#10;def register(callback: Handler) -&gt; None:&#10;    ...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Callable, TypeAlias</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Handler </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Callable[[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">bool</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">JSON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: TypeAlias </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dict[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JSON\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> list[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"JSON\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> str</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> float</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> bool</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> |</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> register</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(callback: Handler) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ...</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常用类型速查\">常用类型速查</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>用途</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Optional[X]</code></td>\n<td>可能为 None</td>\n<td><code>Optional[str]</code> = <code>str | None</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Union[X, Y]</code></td>\n<td>多类型之一</td>\n<td><code>Union[int, str]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Callable</code></td>\n<td>可调用对象</td>\n<td><code>Callable[[int], str]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TypeAlias</code></td>\n<td>类型别名</td>\n<td><code>Vector: TypeAlias = list[float]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Literal</code></td>\n<td>字面量类型</td>\n<td><code>Literal[&quot;r&quot;, &quot;w&quot;, &quot;a&quot;]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Final</code></td>\n<td>不可重赋值</td>\n<td><code>MAX: Final = 100</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>ClassVar</code></td>\n<td>类级别变量</td>\n<td><code>ClassVar[int]</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>TypeGuard</code></td>\n<td>类型收窄谓词</td>\n<td><code>def is_str(v: object) -&gt; TypeGuard[str]</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"typeddict-与结构化字典\">TypedDict 与结构化字典</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from typing import TypedDict, Required, NotRequired&#10;&#10;class UserProfile(TypedDict):&#10;    name: str&#10;    age: int&#10;    email: NotRequired[str]&#10;&#10;def show(user: UserProfile) -&gt; str:&#10;    return f&quot;{user[&#39;name&#39;]}, {user[&#39;age&#39;]}&quot;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> TypedDict, Required, NotRequired</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> UserProfile</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">TypedDict</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    name: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    age: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    email: NotRequired[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> show</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(user: UserProfile) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'name'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">user[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'age'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span></span></code></pre></div><p>TypedDict 可以精确描述 JSON-like 字典结构，尤其适用于 API 返回值和配置对象。相比普通 <code>dict[str, Any]</code>，TypedDict 提供字段级别的类型检查——访问不存在的键、赋值类型不匹配的值都会被静态分析工具捕获。对于嵌套 JSON 结构，TypedDict 支持类继承来组合字段定义，避免重复声明。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"protocol-与结构化子类型\">Protocol 与结构化子类型</h2><p>Protocol 定义了结构化子类型（Structural Subtyping），类似于 Go 的接口或 TypeScript 的鸭子类型——一个类只要实现了 Protocol 要求的方法，无需显式继承即可匹配：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from typing import Protocol&#10;&#10;class Renderable(Protocol):&#10;    def render(self) -&gt; str: ...&#10;&#10;class Button:&#10;    def render(self) -&gt; str:&#10;        return &quot;&lt;button&gt;Click&lt;/button&gt;&quot;&#10;&#10;def display(widget: Renderable) -&gt; None:&#10;    print(widget.render())&#10;&#10;display(Button())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> typing </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> Protocol</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Renderable</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Protocol</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> render</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">...</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Button</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> render</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">str</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"&#x3C;button>Click&#x3C;/button>\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> display</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(widget: Renderable) -> </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(widget.render())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">display(Button())</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"mypy-静态检查\">mypy 静态检查</h2><h3 id=\"基本使用\">基本使用</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"pip install mypy&#10;mypy src/ --strict\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">pip</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> install</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> mypy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">mypy</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> src/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> --strict</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"常见配置-pyproject-toml\">常见配置（pyproject.toml）</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"toml\" data-code=\"[tool.mypy]&#10;python_version = &quot;3.12&quot;&#10;strict = true&#10;warn_return_any = true&#10;disallow_untyped_defs = true\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[tool.mypy]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>python_version = \"3.12\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>strict = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>warn_return_any = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>disallow_untyped_defs = true</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"mypy-错误类型\">mypy 错误类型</h3><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误代码</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>常见原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>[assignment]</code></td>\n<td>赋值类型不匹配</td>\n<td>变量被赋予了不兼容的值</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[arg-type]</code></td>\n<td>参数类型错误</td>\n<td>传入参数与签名不一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[return-value]</code></td>\n<td>返回值类型不匹配</td>\n<td>函数返回了声明之外的类型</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[union-attr]</code></td>\n<td>联合类型属性访问</td>\n<td>未对 Union 做类型收窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>[override]</code></td>\n<td>子类覆盖签名不兼容</td>\n<td>子类方法签名与父类不一致</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"渐进式类型化策略\">渐进式类型化策略</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[未标注项目] --&gt; B[为公共 API 添加标注]&#10;  B --&gt; C[开启 mypy 基础检查]&#10;  C --&gt; D[逐模块开启 strict 模式]&#10;  D --&gt; E[CI 集成 mypy 检查]&#10;  E --&gt; F[全项目 strict 模式]\">graph TD\n  A[未标注项目] --&gt; B[为公共 API 添加标注]\n  B --&gt; C[开启 mypy 基础检查]\n  C --&gt; D[逐模块开启 strict 模式]\n  D --&gt; E[CI 集成 mypy 检查]\n  E --&gt; F[全项目 strict 模式]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>mypy 配置</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>起步</td>\n<td>核心函数签名</td>\n<td>默认配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>进阶</td>\n<td>所有公共 API</td>\n<td><code>disallow_untyped_defs = true</code></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>严格</td>\n<td>全代码库</td>\n<td><code>strict = true</code></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><ul>\n<li>优先标注函数签名（参数 + 返回值），再标注局部变量</li>\n<li>使用 <code>from __future__ import annotations</code> 延迟求值以避免循环导入</li>\n<li>为第三方库缺少的类型存根安装 <code>types-*</code> 包或编写 <code>.pyi</code> 文件</li>\n<li>在 CI 流水线中集成 mypy，将类型检查作为质量门禁</li>\n<li>避免滥用 <code>Any</code>——它会让类型检查失去意义</li>\n<li>使用 Protocol 替代 ABC 来定义接口，实现更灵活的鸭子类型检查</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>标注是静态元数据，不改变运行时行为；运行时校验是另一条独立主线。</li>\n<li>从 3.5 到 3.12，标注语法持续简化：内置泛型、联合类型语法、类型参数语法依次落地。</li>\n<li><code>typing</code> 提供容器、<code>Callable</code>、<code>TypeAlias</code>、<code>Literal</code>、<code>Final</code>、<code>ClassVar</code> 等类型；<code>TypedDict</code> 精确描述 JSON-like 字典。</li>\n<li><code>Protocol</code> 提供结构化子类型，无需显式继承即可匹配接口。</li>\n<li>mypy 是主要静态检查器，按 <code>disallow_untyped_defs</code> → <code>strict</code> 逐级收紧。</li>\n<li>优先标注函数签名、为第三方库补存根、在 CI 中把类型检查作为质量门禁。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"类型标注与 typing 模块","id":"类型标注与-typing-模块"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"基本标注语法","id":"基本标注语法"},{"level":3,"text":"变量与函数标注","id":"变量与函数标注"},{"level":3,"text":"Python 版本演进","id":"python-版本演进"},{"level":2,"text":"typing 模块核心类型","id":"typing-模块核心类型"},{"level":3,"text":"容器与联合类型","id":"容器与联合类型"},{"level":3,"text":"可调用类型与别名","id":"可调用类型与别名"},{"level":3,"text":"常用类型速查","id":"常用类型速查"},{"level":2,"text":"TypedDict 与结构化字典","id":"typeddict-与结构化字典"},{"level":2,"text":"Protocol 与结构化子类型","id":"protocol-与结构化子类型"},{"level":2,"text":"mypy 静态检查","id":"mypy-静态检查"},{"level":3,"text":"基本使用","id":"基本使用"},{"level":3,"text":"常见配置（pyproject.toml）","id":"常见配置-pyproject-toml"},{"level":3,"text":"mypy 错误类型","id":"mypy-错误类型"},{"level":2,"text":"渐进式类型化策略","id":"渐进式类型化策略"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":null,"next":{"title":"Protocol 与结构化子类型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/python-advanced/type-system/protocols"}}